OL,3,GNEWSASix miles of congestion after
OL,4,AMulti-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of the A14 in Northamptonshire has
OL,7,Fbeen shut after a multi-vehicle crash.
OL,9,FThe westbound carriageway was closed
OL,10,Fnear Kelmarsh between junctions two and
OL,11,Fone. One lane has since reopened,
OL,12,FNational Highways said.
OL,14,FThe East Midlands Ambulance Service are
OL,15,Fat the scene, the roads agency added.
OL,17,FThere are delays of 90 minutes and six
OL,18,Fmiles of congestion on the approach
OL,19,Fheading for the M6, it added.
